    "markdown": "Constructs whose Markdown projection depends on the editor's serializer: escaping, marks, lists and blocks.\n\n## Escaping and marks\n\nPlain *stars*, *under_scores*, snake_case_name, \\[brackets\\], `code with ` backtick\\`\\` and a \\\\ backslash. Angle  & ampersand, #hash, 1. not a list, + plus and - minus.\n\n**Bold with *italic inside* and more** then ***both*** and ~~strike~~ **~~bold~~** plus ==highlight== and underline.\n\n\\*\\*\"Quoted bold\"\\*\\*word and a \\*\\*bold \\*\\* with trailing space.\n\nLinks: [titled](https://example.com/a_\\(b\\) \"A \\\"title\\\"\"), bare <https://example.com/path_x>, <https://example.org>, mailto:someone@example.com, image-like !\n\n[link after bang](https://example.com). Code link [`code`](https://example.com/code) and [**bold link**](https://example.com/bold).\n\nLine with hard break\\\ncontinued\\\nand again.\n\n$E = mc^2$ opens this paragraph and `**literal**` stays.\n\n## Lists\n\n- Item one\n- Item with **bold**\\\n  and a hard break\n  - Nested *italic*\n    1. Deep ordered\n\n\n- Second bullet list\n- Right after the first\n\n1. Zero start\n\n2. Next\n\n3. Seven\n\n4. Eight\n\n5. Nine\n\n6. Ten\n\n\n1) Paren list\n2) Second\n\n- Loose item\n\n- Another loose item\n\n  With a second paragraph.\n\n- [ ] Task with continuation\n\n- [x] Done task\n\n  - [ ] Nested task\n\n## Blocks\n\n> Quote first paragraph.\n>\n> **Bold** starts the second paragraph.\n>\n> > Nested quote.\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Tip text with `code`.\n>\n> Second tip paragraph.\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Heading-like title**\n>\n> Important text.\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n>\n> - List inside a callout\n\n### Disclosure \\*title\\* with \\[brackets\\]\n\n- Inside disclosure\n\nParagraph inside.\n\n| Left | Pipe \\| cell | `code` |\n| :--- | :---: | ---: |\n| **b** | a \\| b | x |\n| [l](https://example.com) |  | last |\n\n**Term one**\n\nFirst definition\n\n```js\nconst a = `template ${b}`;\n```\n\n```\nindented code\n```\n\n---\n\n## Heading with trailing hashes\n\n### Heading *with* `code`\n\nObsah dokumentu (automaticky podle nadpisů 1–3)\n\n```mermaid\ngraph TD\n  A[Start] --> B{Choice}\n  B -->|yes| C[Done_1]\n```\n\n$$\nf(x) = \\left[ x^2 \\right]_{0}^{1} * 2\n$$\n\n![Alt text \\[x\\]](/api/attachments/9340fde8-d75c-9a49-57ad-c679bd4e159b/content \"Pic title\")\n\nText right after the image.\n\nLast paragraph with a footnote[\\[1\\]](/#/pages/ae991c1b-8ea7-c28f-6d00-f43479f6cd7d?heading=import-49ef476c3a893e73d3db0817).\n\n## Poznámky pod čarou\n\n1. Footnote with **bold**. [↩](/#/pages/ae991c1b-8ea7-c28f-6d00-f43479f6cd7d?heading=import-36a39c0acc790bea5cda63e2)",
